WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.563
Hello. I am a video, standing on a sheet of paper.

2
00:00:04.763 --> 00:00:06.942
My sound is part of the file.

3
00:00:07.142 --> 00:00:10.701
What I say shows as a line of text, in your language.

4
00:00:10.901 --> 00:00:13.734
You can turn the subtitles off in the settings.
